      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your frustration is understandable because the passion you felt while building that identity is gone, and fixing it changes the foundation, not the player. You are experiencing a profound sense of void rather than a lack of purpose, which can make any artificial identity feel entirely inauthentic. The math only adds up again when the emptiness naturally fills itself over time as the grief of your old self processes and accompanies you in silence.",
